24. The essential ingredients to prove an offence under Section 409 of IPC are:
2025:KER:74540 (i) That the accused was entrusted with the property in any manner;
or That such property was in his dominion, in his capacity of a public servant, or as banker,
merchant, factor, broker, attorney or agent, in the way of his business in such capacity;
(ii) That the accused committed breach of trust in respect of that property.
